SUMMARY:AYPROS Mug Club: FLOUR 
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Young Professionals (AYPROS)\n### **NEW TIME: 8:30
 –10:00 AM**\n\nStart your Thursday with AYPROS at Flour in downtown Ashe
 ville.\nIf Pub Club is your after-work hangout\, Mug Club is the morning v
 ersion. Coffee instead of cocktails\, a little caffeine before the workday
 \, and the same easy chance to catch up with familiar faces and meet other
  young professionals from across Asheville.\n\n##### **And heads up: Mug C
 lub is starting a little later! Beginning this month\, we’re moving from
  8:00–10:00 AM to 8:30–10:00 AM.**\n\nFor October\, we’re headed dow
 ntown to Flour\, a locally owned café on Wall Street serving coffee along
 side scratch-made breakfast\, biscuits and fresh-baked pastries. Come for 
 the coffee\, stay for the company\, and maybe let a biscuit talk you into 
 breakfast.\n\nMug Club is intentionally casual. Leave your business cards 
 at home\, come as you are\, grab a coffee and settle in for a little while
 . No program. No presentations. No awkward agenda. Just good coffee and go
 od people before the workday gets going.\n\nComing by yourself? Perfectly 
 normal. Haven’t been to an AYPROS event before? Even better. Mug Club is
  one of the easiest ways to show up\, meet a few people and see what AYPRO
 S is all about.\n\n**Your first drip coffee is on us.** Specialty drinks\,
  additional coffee and other menu items will be available for purchase.\n\
 nThis is a come-and-go event\, so arrive when you can and stay as long as 
 your morning allows.\n\n## What to Expect\n\n* A relaxed morning at Flour 
 in downtown Asheville\n* Your first drip coffee on us\n* Specialty drinks\
 , breakfast and other menu items available for purchase\n* Plenty of time 
 to catch up with friends and meet new people\n* No formal program\, presen
 tations or agenda\n* Come by yourself\, bring a friend or invite a coworke
 r\n* Come when you can and head out whenever you need to\n\n## Location\n\
 n**Flour**\n40 Wall Street\nAsheville\, NC 28801\n\n**Parking:** Downtown 
 street and garage parking is available nearby\, including the Wall Street 
 Garage at 45 Wall Street.\n\n## Date\n\n**Thursday\, October 8**\n\n## Tim
 e\n\n**NEW TIME: 8:30 AM–10:00 AM**\nCome grab a coffee\, spend a little
  time with Asheville’s young professional community\, and start your Thu
 rsday somewhere other than your inbox.
